# Capacitor Android native project — the project itself (android/) IS
# committed (MainActivity, AndroidManifest, res/, gradle config — none of
# that regenerates from `npx cap add android` alone once customized), but
# these are either machine-specific, rebuildable, or secret:
/fables/android/local.properties
/fables/android/.gradle/
/fables/android/**/build/
/fables/android/captures/
/fables/android/app/google-services.json
/fables/android/app/*.keystore
/fables/android/app/*.jks
*.keystore
*.jks

